OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry with variable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud and some bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells, overnight fog patches
OL,8,Fslowly clearing. Becoming rather
OL,9,Fcloudy across the east during the
OL,10,Fafternoon, perhaps with a light shower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCllear spells across the west
OL,13,Fwith a touch of frost. Otherwise it
OL,14,Fwill be a mainly cloudy evening and
OL,15,Fnight with one or two light showers in
OL,16,Fthe east.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FDry with some bright or sunny
OL,19,Fintervals in the west. Cloudier across
OL,20,Fthe east with the odd light shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
