OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Saturday with the chance of a few
OL,7,Flight showers in the east. Dry on
OL,8,FSunday and Monday with broken cloud
OL,9,Fand overnight frost and fog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
